    "detailed_description": "The official game made for the Git Together 1 jam!<br><br>You are a robot named Ed with the ability to dream. Use your abilities to platform through levels and dream your way around obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play through seven unique stages with an emphasis on different mechanics.<br></li><li>Use &quot;dream mode&quot; to edit your surroundings and imagine solutions to these challenges.<br></li><li>Hug giraffes.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2>Move - WASD / Arrow keys<br>Dream mode - Right mouse button<br>Place/delete blocks - Left/right mouse button while in dream mode<br>Pause - Escape<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Contributors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Leo Jansson - Code, Level Design<br></li><li>Casey MacNeil - Visuals<br></li><li>Bauke Regnerus - Bouncy Block, Programmer<br></li><li>Jacob S. - Art, NPCs<br></li><li>Nicholas Smith - Code, Visuals, Sound, Tutorial<br></li><li>Yosi - Code, Shaders<br></li><li>Ahmed Yasir - Level Design<br></li><li>SurgDev - Slime &amp; Ice<br></li><li>Mason Young - Music<br></li><li>Katsaii - Concept<br></li><li>Sohom Sahaun - Organization<br></li><li>TonyStr - Dream Mode<br></li><li>nut4985 - Switch Art<br></li><li>King Cubing - Moral Support</li></ul>",
